#. module: account_3way_match
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_3way_match
msgid ""
"\n"
"Manage 3-way matching on vendor bills\n"
"=====================================\n"
"\n"
"In the manufacturing industry, people often receive the vendor bills before\n"
"receiving their purchase, but they don't want to pay the bill until the "
"goods\n"
"have been delivered.\n"
"\n"
"The solution to this situation is to create the vendor bill when you get it\n"
"(based on ordered quantities) but only pay the invoice when the received\n"
"quantities (on the PO lines) match the recorded vendor bill.\n"
"\n"
"This module introduces a \"release to pay\" mechanism that marks for each "
"vendor\n"
"bill whether it can be paid or not.\n"
"\n"
"Each vendor bill receives one of the following three states:\n"
"\n"
"    - Yes (The bill can be paid)\n"
"    - No (The bill cannot be paid, nothing has been delivered yet)\n"
"    - Exception (Received and invoiced quantities differ)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"仕入先請求書で3点照合(発注・入荷・請求)を管理\n"
"=====================================\n"
"\n"
"製造業では、仕入れ品が入荷する前に仕入先請求書を受け取ることがよくありますが"
"、\n"
"商品が納品されるまでは請求書を支払いたくない、\n"
"というケースがあります。\n"
"\n"
"これに対応するには、請求書を受け取った時点で\n"
"(オーダ数量に基づいて)仕入先請求書を作成しておき、入荷\n"
"数量(購買オーダ明細行の入荷数量)が仕入先請求書に記録された数量と一致した場合"
"にのみ、その請求書を支払うようにすることです。\n"
"\n"
"このモジュールは、各仕入先請求書について支払い可能かどうかを示す\n"
"「支払い許可」機能を導入します。\n"
"\n"
"各仕入先請求書には、次の3つの状態のいずれかが設定されます:\n"
"\n"
"    - はい (請求書の支払が可能)\n"
"    - いいえ (支払い不可：まだ入荷がない)\n"
"    - 例外 (入荷数量と請求数量が一致しない)\n"

#. module: account_3way_match
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_3way_match.field_account_bank_statement_line__release_to_pay_manual
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_3way_match.field_account_move__release_to_pay_manual
msgid ""
"  * Yes: you should pay the bill, you have received the products\n"
"  * No, you should not pay the bill, you have not received the products\n"
"  * Exception, there is a difference between received and billed quantities\n"
"This status is defined automatically, but you can force it by ticking the "
"'Force Status' checkbox."
msgstr ""
"  *はい: 請求書を支払うべきです。プロダクトをすでに受領済みです\n"
"  *いいえ: 請求書を支払うべきではありません。プロダクトをまだ受領していませ"
"ん\n"
"  *例外: 受領数量と請求数量に差異があります\n"
"このステータスは自動的に設定されますが、「ステータスを強制」の"
"チェックボックスをオンにすることで手動で設定することも可能です。"

